#: 9b3e28ee2fc14524be90ebbdfd6bb6a3
msgid "The `FLIR Vue Pro <https://www.flir.com/products/vue-pro/>`__ infrared camera supports MAVLink which allows the camera to add position and attitude information to each image stored on its internal SD card"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:11
#: 6124afac405b48b693751f4d88244abc
msgid "The Flir Vue Pro MAVLink interface appears to be broken in the latest firmware from FLIR (ver 3.3.2) meaning pictures taken will not include EXIF data of the vehicle's position and attitude"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:16
#: 11cee599c33b47d88e97d7af7fb1ce1f
msgid "*image courtesy of flir.com*"
msgstr ""

